               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>anhydrous citric acid, FD&amp;C blue #1, FD&amp;C red #40, FD&amp;C yellow #6, flavors, glycerin, propylene glycol, purified water, sodium benzoate, sucralose, xanthan gum<br/>
                  </paragraph>
